# w.lang.en/shards/determiners: determiners, quantifiers and the small numerals that can start a noun phrase. `in=` names the PSys2 view (one hand-made list in one module) the word belongs to; the seven views differ only by accident
# (PSys2 wrote the list again in acts.mjs, expand.mjs, dialogue.mjs, discourse.mjs, routing.mjs and the forms) and are to be unified by a decision, see README "holes". A word's grammar is its kind, number, definiteness and person.
# sources: PSys2 (hand-written); the full cardinal and ordinal numbers are k.values.number, not repeated here
# license: CC0-1.0

